  "title": "Rebirth",
  "justification": "TVDB 374471 season 1 has 48 episodes and its Japanese titles skip from 第24話 to 第26話: there is no episode 25, and AniDB lists a phantom, untitled 25. AniDB 26 2-fun de Wakaru?? Rebirth = S1E25, 29 Aru Shizuka na Hi = S1E28, 38 Kimi to Mata, Au Tame ni = S1E37, 49 Rebirth Onsen Gasshuku = S1E48; the default shifted every episode from 25 by one. AniDB special S1 Virtual to no Souguu (2020-08-21) is TVDB season 0 episode 3 特別編 ヴァーチャルとの遭遇 and TMDB 96484 season 0 episode 1 of that title; S2, a 2020-11-29 special, has no TVDB or TMDB episode, where its defaults were a TCG how-to video and a 2022 short.",
